OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785158323
OL,3,CMurder investigation launched
OL,4,Cfollowing death of woman in Leeds
OL,6,FPolice have made an arrest and
OL,7,Flaunched a murder investigation
OL,8,Ffollowing the death of a woman in
OL,9,FLeeds.
OL,11,FWest Yorkshire Police were called to
OL,12,FCottingley Towers at around 11:40pm on
OL,13,FFriday 24 July after a report of
OL,14,Fconcern for persons inside one of the
OL,15,Fflats.
OL,17,FOfficers attended the location and
OL,18,Fdiscovered the body of a 58-year-old
OL,19,Fwoman, who was confirmed dead at the
OL,20,Fscene.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/3
