OL,3,CMurder investigation launched
OL,4,Cfollowing death of woman in Leeds
OL,6,FA 52-year-old man was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder. He remains in
OL,8,Fpolice custody.
OL,10,FDetective Chief Inspector Eleanor
OL,11,FBuchanan, of the Homicide and Major
OL,12,FEnquiry Team, said: "This has clearly
OL,13,Fbeen a very serious incident, and we
OL,14,Fare continuing to investigate the
OL,15,Fcircumstances of what took place at
OL,16,Fthis address.
OL,26,@tD@UOU
