OL,3,CMurder investigation launched
OL,4,Cfollowing death of woman in Leeds
OL,6,F"We are continuing to hold a man in
OL,7,Fcustody on suspicion of murder, and
OL,8,Fspecially trained officers are
OL,9,Fsupporting the victim's family at this
OL,10,Ftime."
OL,12,FShe urged anyone with information to
OL,13,Fcontact the force.
